{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n周嘉洛在TVB節目《Grand 住去首爾》中，到訪韓星御用的頂尖美容店體驗韓妝大改造，起初他還興趣不大，沒想到改造後效果驚人！他以一身真空西裝look在首爾街頭行走，竟被韓國民眾誤以為是人氣男團SEVENTEEN成員珉奎，場面極為搶Fo，究竟他變身後有多似韓星？\n</p>\n<h2>周嘉洛韓妝大改造 真空西裝look行街被當珉奎</h2>\n<p>節目中，周嘉洛被安排到首爾最頂尖的美容店體驗韓妝，他坦言對化Idol妝興趣不大，更搞笑表示：「我哋係好明顯行內涵同靈魂。」不過，經過韓國化妝師的巧手改造後，嘉洛的五官輪廓即時變得更立體，髮型亦添上韓系俐落感，整體氣質大升級。他更真空上陣穿上西裝，大騷胸肌，並以冷酷姿態在街道行走，極有韓星Feel，隨即吸引不少韓國民眾影相，更有當地民眾誤以為他是韓國男團SEVENTEEN的成員珉奎，可見改造極之成功。</p>\n<h2>周嘉洛嚇到耍手擰頭 強調：「佢靚仔過我好多」</h2>\n<p>對於在街頭被誤認為SEVENTEEN成員珉奎，周嘉洛本人亦感到非常驚訝。面對這個美麗的誤會，他即時耍手擰頭，非常謙虛地否認。他更再三強調自己與對方完全不像，並向鏡頭表示：「我強調佢靚仔過我好多，我同佢一啲都唔似。」他驚慌又搞笑的反應，再次展現其獨特的綜藝魅力，令觀眾捧腹大笑。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式激讚周嘉洛 封佢做搞笑天才</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，周嘉洛的表現成功引起網民洗版式討論，大家紛紛激讚他極具綜藝感，是天生的搞笑能手。網民留言大讚：「佢真係好正，天生就有種綜藝感」、「搞笑天才嚟」、「佢勁有喜感，一出嚟已經覺得佢調皮會玩」、「注定天生食呢行飯」。可見嘉洛在節目中的搞笑演出已成功入屋，深受觀眾喜愛。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/28_10977688516af7e4f858393.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/28_10977688516af7e4f858393.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/30_4153294706af7e5062b4c1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/30_4153294706af7e5062b4c1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_16828198576af7e548a1ed3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_16828198576af7e548a1ed3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_21461773396af7e50d9631d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_21461773396af7e50d9631d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_4892489756af7e5199f992.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_4892489756af7e5199f992.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/33_9043289806af7e52645f32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/33_9043289806af7e52645f32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/34_550936796af7e5337ed9f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/34_550936796af7e5337ed9f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_13368091766af7e53c297c6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_13368091766af7e53c297c6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_14802458196af7e543ba1a2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_14802458196af7e543ba1a2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:44:37.455185+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":988,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T11:15:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:18:21.581046+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:37:53.122560+00:00","content_hash":"01e8aae0c46044107f33066a3d9d3b2bf788848f823e5dcfad48072eda6185aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null